/T (In addition to her research and teaching, Dr. Lapucci has organized and contributed to exhibitions and publications, always maintaining a strong interest in the relationship between connoisseurship and scientific evidence. Her work is characterized by methodological care: rather than relying on simplified claims, she emphasizes the need to examine each object through a combination of documentary evidence, historical comparison, stylistic reading, and diagnostic investigation.)
