/T (Mr. Jovan Mizzi is a Maltese independent researcher specializing in Caravaggio studies, attribution research, and provenance investigations. Originally trained as a marine engineer, he developed an analytical approach grounded in logical consistency, direct observation, and the careful examination of unresolved anomalies. His later experience in photography and the family antiques business deepened his understanding of visual perception, craftsmanship, and authenticity. )
