/P 341 0 R
/T (After the remarkable presentations by Dr. Roberta Lapucci, Dr. Barbara Savina and Dr Fabio Scaletti, who explored the painting from technical, historical and conservation perspectives,  I would like to offer a personal obser vation.)
/E (After the remarkable presentations by Dr. Roberta Lapucci, Dr. Barbara Savina and Dr Fabio Scaletti, who explored the painting from technical, historical and conservation perspectives,  I would like to offer a personal obser vation.)
