/P 341 0 R
/T (That experience led me to a simple conclusion. Great paintings behave like energy absorbers: they return what is given to them. Light, space, distance and the movement of the viewer all become part of the experience.)
/E (That experience led me to a simple conclusion. Great paintings behave like energy absorbers: they return what is given to them. Light, space, distance and the movement of the viewer all become part of the experience.)
/Pg 58 0 R
/K [4]
>>
