<<
/Title (Dr. Alessandra Gregori is a prominent Italian specialist in the authentication, attribution, and valuation of Old Master paintings, with particular expertise in works by Caravaggio and the complex artistic production associated with his international circle. She is the niece of the legendary Professor Mina Gregori one of the most respected and foundational authorities in modern Caravaggio studies. Carrying forward this distinguished scholarly lineage, Dr. Gregori continues a rigorous tradition of traditional connoisseurship, archival analysis, and deep historical research into Italian Baroque painting. Her work routinely bridges the gap between stylistic analysis, historical context, and the fine-grained questions of disputed authorship.)
/Dest [52 0 R /Fit]
